3
00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
In the late 1960s, the Beach Boys' Brian Wilson stops touring, produces
"Pet Sounds" and begins to lose his grip on reality.

4
00:17:08,571 --> 00:17:14,571
By the 1980s, under the sway of a controlling therapist,
he finds a savior in Melinda Ledbetter.

